{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】訪問歐洲巴爾幹半島的外長王毅與黑山總理斯帕伊奇會面。</p>\n<p>王毅說中國和黑山有很多共同之處，包括取得反法西斯戰爭勝利，也警惕軍國主義的復活。</p>\n<p>斯帕伊奇讚賞中國在中東戰事以負責任態度，抑制全球油價上漲，幫助黑山等中小國家渡過能源危機。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:27.609751+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:21:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:44.924292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:44.924292+00:00","content_hash":"9a5570abbba2ce4745ee2b2f3e5d842340e49868d27a7e8c168e4f6af4d61c82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}